# Fal-X configuration. Copy to config/.env and fill in real values.
#
# config/.env is parsed as KEY=VALUE DATA by util.EnvFile. It is never sourced
# or evaluated, so command substitution, pipes and `export` cannot execute. Keys
# must match ^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*$.
#
# Every value here is optional. Fal-X degrades gracefully when a credential is
# absent, but the corresponding enrichment is then skipped and recorded as such in
# the run manifest.
#
# .env is gitignored. Never commit real values. Rotate any credential that has
# ever been committed, pasted into a chat, or written into output/.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Censys Platform API token. Used only by --censys for passive service lookup.
# Free tier: https://account.censys.io/
# CENSYS_TOKEN=
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub token. Optional. subfinder uses it to raise GitHub API rate limits
# when it is on PATH; leaving it empty just means lower passive coverage.
# Scope it to public repo read access only. Never use a personal token with
# repo or workflow scopes.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional enrichment credentials for later stages. All optional.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Shodan API key. Used by the passive service-enrichment path.
# SHODAN_API_KEY=

# NVD API key. Only needed if you want full NVD depth in the CVE matching
# stage. Without it that stage uses EPSS + CISA KEV, which needs no key.
# https://nvd.nist.gov/developers/request-an-api-key
# NVD_API_KEY=

# VirusTotal API key. Optional reputation lookup for discovered URLs.
# VIRUSTOTAL_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notification targets for --notify. At most one is required.
# Values are written into run artifacts, so keep tokens out of the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# NOTIFY_WEBHOOK_URL=
# NOTIFY_TELEGRAM_TOKEN=
# NOTIFY_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
# NOTIFY_SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=
# NOTIFY_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=